        indicator_of_notMem (show z ∉ (fun z => z - (t - t₀)) ⁻¹' M₀ from hzv)]
  -- (d) product formula: `♭` is continuous linear, `S(ω) = ∫_M θ ζ(♭ω) dHⁿ`, signed coarea,
  -- then (★) and translation by `t − t₀`
